s、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":19,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:43.923Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"fb4a1ae6-d713-43a9-8bd2-dec2983ee7bf","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt_id":"fb4a1ae6-d713-43a9-8bd2-dec2983ee7bf","session_id":"0a9eac61-fd54-4b27-b2ab-8bc456580794","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"d7709cf2-09b6-4597-99af-aa51c7aa60ea","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"b65b9858-51d2-4462-bb15-77921b98e460","thread":"d7709cf2-09b6-4597-99af-aa51c7aa60ea","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-b65b9858-51d2-4462-bb15-77921b98e460"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-x1snjpxl/state/worktrees/fb4a1ae6-d713-43a9-8bd2-dec2983ee7bf","base_commit":"73d97d6fb2fd1a02940b554d80b5598f4b9282ad","card_snapshot_id":"9372c527-24c5-4e3e-9c83-56f3b40f3cd3","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261011-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":20,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:45.154Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"fb4a1ae6-d713-43a9-8bd2-dec2983ee7bf","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-x1snjpxl/repo","cat-file","-t","b6a3cea1142b5e9aa38878c84f5b4aefabc5bf58"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-x1snjpxl/repo"}},{"seq":21,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:45.160Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"fb4a1ae6-d713-43a9-8bd2-dec2983ee7bf","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-x1snjpxl/repo","cat-file","-t","b6a3cea1142b5e9aa38878c84f5b4aefabc5bf58"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-x1snjpxl/repo","stdout":"commit\n","stderr":"","exit":0,"returncode":0}},{"seq":22,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:45.160Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"fb4a1ae6-d713-43a9-8bd2-dec2983ee7bf","type":